  "title": "",
  "body": " True or false:   When can you use the power rule?  False  The power rule tells us that . In this equation, the variable is the base, and the exponent is a constant. In the function , it's reversed: the variable is the exponent, and the base it a constant. So, the power rule does not apply.  "
