  "body": "Derivatives of  Let be a natural number and let . Then Each time we differentiate, we bring down the exponent, which is exactly one smaller than the previous exponent brought down, and we reduce the exponent by one. By the time we have differentiated times, the exponent has decreased to and we have brought down the factors . So and The product of the first natural numbers, is called factorial and is denoted . So we can also write If , then  "
